          "question": "Tail: 90 requests at 1.0 s, 10 at 3.0 s. Compute mean, p50, p99, concurrency at 50 req/s.",
          "answer": "Mean 1.2, p50 1.0, p99 3.0, concurrency 60. Tail fixed: all 1.0, concurrency 50.",
